# Keep Cursor / OpenCode agent docs in sync

OpenCode is the job-assist LLM. Cursor is for local debug. Standing
instructions live in the tool directories, not the repo root.

When you change job-assist standing instructions, update **all** English
copies in the same edit:

- `.opencode/AGENTS.md`
- `.opencode/agent/job-assist.md`
- `.cursor/rules/job-assist.mdc`

When you change the Chinese translation, update **all** in the same edit:

- `.opencode/AGENTS.zh.md`
- `.cursor/rules/job-assist.zh.md`

Do not place `*.zh.md` under `.opencode/agent/` (OpenCode would register
another agent from the filename). Do not add root `AGENTS.md` / `agent.md` / `skills.md`.
`tests/test_agents_md_sync.py` must stay green.

OpenSpec / Cursor command skills under `.cursor/` are **not** duplicated into
`.opencode/skills/`. Job-assist skills under `.opencode/skills/` are **not**
duplicated into `.cursor/`. Only the standing job-assist instruction files
above stay in lockstep.
